<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility carcasses steady to weak; Cutter weak. Demand light to moderate for moderate to heavy offerings. - USDA.</p>
<p>    COW &amp; BULL CARCASS FOB OMAHA	  11.0  Loads Reported.</p>
<p>			  Lds     Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up  2.0   53.50		 53.50</p>
<p>UT,bng 1-3 400#/up  2.0   57.50		 57.50</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up  7.0   56.50 - 57.00     56.50 - 57.00</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up			    unq</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>    COW &amp; BULL CARCASS CAF WEST COAST  74.0   Loads Reported.</p>
<p>Utility and Cutter carcasses $2.00 lower. Demand moderate for moderate to heavy offerings.</p>
<p>Market for Week Ended: October 25, 1996</p>
<p>			   Lds	Price Range</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up UT,bng 1-3 400#/up   39.0	 58.00</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up   35.0	 58.00</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up</p>
